(text "AI-4 CARD, card type 0x0011. 4 configurable analog inputs (0-5/0-10 V, 4-20 mA\nshunt, resistive sender via current source).\nSelf-contained: own ADS1115 (0x48 on the slot I2C bus), own VMID buffer, own\nVBAT_AI pre-regulator and LM4040 current-source reference, own MCP23S17.\nMCP23S17: GPA0-3 CS_DIS1-4, GPA4-7 SH_EN1-4; GPB0-3 slot ID straps. 4-20 mA\nshunts only close while OUT_EN_N is low (replaces SH_ALLOW AND gate).\nBaseline names: IN1..IN4 = AI3..AI6. Net changes: net_changes.csv." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 124.46 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c0c144a2-5d47-4709-9d4b-4a331bbdcfb0"))
